ng\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"文中引述甲骨文字形“卩”像人跪拜之形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"文中引述甲骨文“午”字形其一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"文中引述甲骨文“午”字形其二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"文中引述西周“午”字形变\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"文中引述西周“禦”字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"秦代文字“禦”所从御旁中的辵/彳形小篆或古文字偏旁\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"汉代文字中讹变出的偏旁形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"小篆“栝/祑”字，左示右昏\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"楷书异体字，左示右昏（祑）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"小篆“禖”字，左示右某\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"小篆“挀/𥛱”字，左示右辰\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"楷书异体字，左示右辰（𥛱）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0023/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n31:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000031\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 31, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"e737bb45928d0f53c6925d878cfd911299ff53d7cce29283a0d8f9b2e1b8b3b4\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"41f41f98dd011b0df809f5255204f2a392aa9124f363c652722024b6f91970aa\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"玠 暘 瑑 珽 瑁 珩 玦 瑞 珥 瑱 琫 璪 瑳 玼\\n\\n瑞\\nruì 禅纽、歌部；禅纽、寘韵、是伪切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹—[glyph:g002]²—[glyph:g003]³—瑞\\n战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《楚系简帛》44页。2《说文》11页。3《篆隶表》19页。\\n形声字。从玉，耑声。本义是指古代玉制的信物，相当于后世的印信。《说文》：“瑞，以玉为信也。”王筠句读：“犹今言印信，故璧、琮、琥及《土部》‘圭’下皆云‘瑞玉’。”《玉篇·玉部》：“瑞，信节也，诸侯之珪也。”“瑞”字古又有吉祥之义。《古今韵会举要·寘韵》：“瑞，祥瑞也。”《史记·礼书》：“古者太平，万民和喜，瑞应辨至。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n珥\\něr 日纽、之部；日纽、志韵、仍吏切。\\n[glyph:g004]¹—[glyph:g005]²—[glyph:g006]³—珥\\n战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《楚系简帛》44页。2《说文》11页。3《篆隶表》19页。\\n形声字。从玉，耳声。本义是指古代的珠玉耳饰，也叫“瑱”。《说文》：“珥，瑱也。”《玉篇·玉部》：“珥，珠在耳。”又指剑鼻，即剑柄上端似两耳的突出部分。《广雅·释器》：“剑珥谓之镡。”王念孙疏证：“《说文》：‘镡，剑鼻也。’……剑鼻谓之镡，镡谓之珥。”引申之还可指日、月两旁的光晕。《释名·释天》：“珥，气在日两旁之名也。珥，耳也，言似人耳之在两旁也。”《隋书·天文志下》：“月晕有两珥，白虹贯之。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n瑱\\ntiàn 透纽、真部；透纽、霰韵、他甸切。\\n[glyph:g007]¹—[glyph:g009]³—瑱\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n[glyph:g008]²\\n《说文》或体\\n1、2《说文》11页。3《篆隶表》20页。\\n形声字。从玉，真声。本义是古代冠冕上的玉质饰件，系于冠冕，自两侧垂于耳旁，用来塞耳，故又名“充耳”。《说文》：“瑱，以玉充耳也。”《释名·释首饰》：“瑱，镇也。悬当耳傍，不欲使人妄听，自慎重也。”又可当玉名讲。《广韵·霰韵》：“瑱，玉名。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n琫\\nběng 帮纽、东部；帮纽、董韵、边孔切。\\n[glyph:g010]¹—[glyph:g011]²—琫\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》11页。2《篆隶表》20页。\\n形声字。从玉，奉声。本义是一种古代佩刀鞘口上的装饰。《说文》：“琫，佩刀上饰。天子以玉，诸侯以金。”《释名·释兵》：“(刀)其室曰削……室口之饰曰琫。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n璪\\nzǎo 精纽、宵部；精纽、晧韵、子晧切。\\n[glyph:g012]¹—璪\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》11页。\\n形声字。从玉，喿声。本义是指雕有水藻花纹的玉饰。《说文》：“璪，玉饰如水藻之文。”又可指玉名。《广韵·晧韵》：“璪，玉名。”又可指用五彩丝绳制作的冕饰。《礼记·郊特性》：“(王)戴冕璪十有二旒。”孙希旦集解：“璪者，用五采丝为绳，垂之以为冕之旒也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n瑳\\ncuō 清纽、歌部；清纽、歌韵、七何切。\\n[glyph:g013]¹—瑳\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》11页。\\n形声字。从玉，差声。本义是指玉色鲜白。《说文》：“瑳，玉色鲜白。”引申之也可用以形容物色洁白。《正字通·玉部》：“瑳，凡物色鲜盛亦曰瑳。”又可形容人之巧笑貌。《诗·卫风·竹竿》：“巧笑之瑳，佩玉之傩。”毛传：“瑳，巧笑貌。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n玼\\ncǐ 清纽、支部；清纽、纸韵、雌氏切。\\ncī 从纽、支韵、疾移切。\\n[glyph:g014]¹—玼\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》11页。\\n形声字。从玉，此声。本义是指玉色鲜明貌，读cǐ。《说文》：“玼，玉色鲜也。”又可指玉石上的斑点。《广韵·支韵》：“玼，玉病。”《正字通·玉部》：“玼，玉病，与疵通。”汉桓宽《盐铁论·晁错》：“夫以玙璠之玼而弃其\\n19\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"战国楚简帛文字「瑞」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「瑞」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「瑞」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"战国楚简帛文字「珥」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「珥」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「珥」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「瑱」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"《说文》或体「瑱」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「瑱」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「琫」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「琫」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「璪」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「瑳」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「玼」\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0031/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n32:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000032\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 32, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"71a29c852e506d49a9bfa8667e54278dfc41523e9a52a98080dec041f634c5ca\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"9bca2f60b86e839f2747d742fcc66c6a907f2b7124b4e3c3b7dc9dc1d6117357\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"玉部\\n\\n璞,以一人之罪而兼其众,则天下无美宝、信士也。”又指玉中之石。《集韵·支韵》:“玼,玉中石也。”以上读 cī。(白于蓝)\\n\\n莹(莹) yíng 匣纽、耕部;云纽、庚韵、永兵切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹—[glyph:g002]²—莹—莹\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》12页。2《篆隶表》20页。\\n\\n形声字。从玉,熒省声。本义是指玉色光洁。《说文》:“莹,玉色。……《逸论语》曰:‘如玉之莹。’”段玉裁注:“莹,谓玉光明之貌。”又可指似玉美石。《说文》:“莹,一日石之次玉者。”《诗·齐风·著》:“充耳以青乎而,尚之以琼莹乎而。”毛传:“琼、莹,石似玉,卿大夫之服也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n璘(璘) mén 明纽、文部;明纽、魂韵、莫奔切。\\n\\n[glyph:g003]¹—璘—璘\\n《说文》小篆 楷书 楷书\\n＼[glyph:g004]²\\n《说文》或体\\n1、2《说文》12页。\\n\\n形声字。从玉,粦声。本义是指赤色之玉。《说文》:“璘,玉柽色也。”《广韵·魂韵》:“璘,玉色赤也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n瑕 xiá 匣纽、鱼部;匣纽、麻韵、胡加切。\\n\\n[glyph:g005]¹—[glyph:g006]²—[glyph:g007]³—瑕\\n战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《汉语字形表》15页。2《说文》12页。3《篆隶表》20页。\\n\\n形声字。从玉,段声。本义是指带红色的玉。《说文》:“瑕,玉小赤也。”又可指玉的暗斑或疵病。《广韵·麻韵》:“瑕,玉病也。”《礼记·聘义》:“瑕不掩瑜,瑜不掩瑕,忠也。”郑玄注:“瑕,玉之病也。”引申之亦可泛指人之缺点、过错。《诗·豳风·狼跋》:“公孙硕肤,德音不瑕。”毛传:“瑕,过也。”孔颖达疏:“瑕者,玉之病,玉之有瑕,犹人之有过,故以瑕为过。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n琢 zhuó 端纽、屋部;知纽、觉韵、竹角切。\\n\\n[glyph:g008]¹—[glyph:g009]²—琢\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》12页。2《篆隶表》20页。\\n\\n形声字。从玉,豕声。本义是指加工玉石。《说文》:“琢,治玉也。”《尔雅·释器》:“玉谓之琢,石谓之磨。”《诗·卫风·淇奥》:“如切如磋,如琢如磨。”毛传:“治骨曰切,象曰磋,玉曰琢,石曰磨。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n琱 diāo 端纽、幽部;端纽、萧韵、都聊切。\\n\\n[glyph:g010]¹—[glyph:g011]²—琱\\n西周 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《金文编》25页。2《说文》12页。\\n\\n形声字。从玉,周声。本义是指治玉、雕刻,后作“雕”。《说文》:“琱,治玉也。”《尔雅·释器》:“玉谓之雕。”郭璞注:“治璞之名。”《广韵·萧韵》:“琱,治璞也。”又可指似玉之石。《说文》:“琱,一日石似玉。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n理 lǐ 来纽、之部;来纽、止韵、良士切。\\n\\n[glyph:g012]¹—[glyph:g013]²—理\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》12页。2《篆隶表》20页。\\n\\n形声字。从玉,里声。本义是指治玉。《说文》:“理,治玉也。”《韩非子·和氏》:“王乃使玉人理其璞而得宝焉,遂命曰‘和氏之璧’。”引申之义为治理、料理。《广雅·释诂三》:“理,治也。”《广韵·止韵》:“理,料理。”《淮南子·时则》:“理关市,来商旅。”引申之又有条理、纹理、道理等义。(白于蓝)\\n\\n珍 zhēn 端纽、文部;知纽、真韵、陟邻切。\\n\\n[glyph:g014]¹—[glyph:g015]²—珍\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》12页。2《篆隶表》21页。\\n\\n形声字。从玉,㐱声。本义是指珠宝之类的宝物。《说文》:“珍,宝也。”《楚辞·招魂》:“室中之观,多珍怪些。”王逸注:“金玉为珍。”引申之则有宝贵之义。《玉篇·玉部》:“珍,贵也,重也。”《书·旅獒》:“珍禽奇兽,不育于国。”引申之又有精美之义。《尔雅·释诂上》:“珍,美也。”郝懿行义疏:“珍者,宝之美也。”引申之又有重视、珍重之义。《广雅·释诂三》:“珍,重也。”《左\\n\\n20\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0032/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0032/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0032/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"小篆《说文》“莹”字，从玉，熒省声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0032/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"汉隶“莹”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0032/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"小篆《说文》“璘”字，从玉，粦声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0032/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"小篆《说文》“璘”字或体，从玉，瞵省声或从目从粦\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0032/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"战国古文“瑕”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0032/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"小篆《说文》“瑕”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0032/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉隶“瑕”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\"