g\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"战国文字“苾”，下部从土繁化\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0062/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“苾”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0062/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“苾”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0062/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"战国文字“芳”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0062/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“芳”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0062/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“芳”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0062/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n63:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000063\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 63, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"3f98e7bd3509cc7e993722a863aa8867c1ac003634ecdb8a1c6c6cfb40a3fe1b\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"d00e7579c03488c685053b967a97476145dd6dbdeacec693841b9dbf77a7b33d\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"藪 菑 薤 茀 苾 芳 糞 藥 蓆 艾 荐 藉\\n\\n表》50页。\\n形声字。从艸,方声。本义是指花草的香气。《说文》:“芳,艸香。”《楚辞·离骚》:“兰芷变而不芳兮,荃蕙化而为茅。”引申之又可指香草,也泛指花卉。《楚辞·离骚》:“哀群芳之芜秽。”又可指有贤德之人。《楚辞·离骚》:“昔三后之纯粹兮,固众芳之所在。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n糞(粪) fèn 普纽、文部;奉纽、文韵、符分切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹-[glyph:g002]²-糞-糞\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》24页。2《篆隶表》51页。\\n形声字。从艸,糞声。本义是指杂草的香气。《说文》:“糞,杂香艸。”段玉裁注:“当作杂艸香。”徐灏注笺:“今俗语犹言粪香。”又可指草木果实繁盛貌。《尔雅·释木》:“糞,蔼。”郭璞注:“树实繁茂菴藹。”《玉篇·艸部》:“糞,草木多实。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n藥(药) yào 喻纽、药部;以纽、药韵、以灼切。\\n[glyph:g003]¹-[glyph:g004]²-[glyph:g005]³-藥-药\\n战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《战文编》34页。2《说文》24页。3《篆文编》51页。\\n形声字。从艸,樂声。本义是指能够治疗疾病的植物。《说文》:“藥,治病艸。”《玉篇·艸部》:“药,《说文》曰:‘治疾之草总名。’”后泛指可治病之物。《周礼·天官·疾医》:“以五味、五谷、五药养其病。”郑玄注:“五药,草、木、虫、石、谷也。”晋葛洪《神仙传·刘根》:“草木诸药,能治百病。”引申之又可指用药治疗疾病。《诗·大雅·板》:“多将熇熇,不可救药。”《荀子·富国》:“彼得之不足以药伤补败。”杨倞注:“药,犹医也。”汉荀悦《申鉴·俗嫌》:“药者疗也,所以治疾也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n蓆 xí 邪纽、铎部;邪纽、昔韵、祥易切。\\n[glyph:g006]¹-蓆-蓆\\n《说文》小篆 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》24页。\\n形声字。从艸,席声。本义是指广多。《说文》:“蓆,广多也。”段玉裁注:“《郑风》:‘缁衣之蓆兮。’《释故》、毛传皆云:‘蓆,大也。’《韩诗》云:‘储也。’广义与大近,多义与储近。”又可假借为“席”。《韩非子·存韩》:“韩事秦三十余年,出则为扞蔽,入则为蓆荐。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n艾 shān 心纽、谈部;生纽、衔韵、所衔切。\\n[glyph:g007]¹-[glyph:g008]²-艾-艾\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》24页。2《篆隶表》51页。\\n会意字。从艸,从殳。会以殳杀草之义。本义是指除草。《说文》:“艾,刈艸也。”《诗·周颂·载芟》:“载芟载柞,其耕泽泽。”毛传:“除草曰芟,除木曰柞。”引申之又可指削除。南朝梁刘勰《文心雕龙·镕裁》:“艾繁剪秽,弛于负担。”又可指大镰刀。《国语·齐语》:“耒、耜、枷、艾。”韦昭注:“艾,大镰,所以芟草也。”(白于蓝)\\n\\n荐 jiàn 从纽、文部;从纽、霰韵、在甸切。\\n[glyph:g009]¹-荐-荐\\n《说文》小篆 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》24页。\\n形声字。从艸,存声。本义是指草席,又指席子下面的垫草。《说文》:“荐,薦蓆也。”段玉裁注:“薦见《薦部》,艸也。不云‘艸席’云‘薦席’者,取音近也。席,各本误蓆。薦席为承藉,与所藉者为二。”王筠句读:“薦、荐皆为席下之艸。”又可指牧草。《左传·襄公四年》:“戎狄荐居,贵货易土。”孔颖达疏:“服虔云:‘荐,草也。言狄人逐水草而居,徙无常处。’刘炫案:‘庄子云:麋鹿食荐,即荐是草也。’” (白于蓝)\\n\\n藉 jiè 从纽、铎部;从纽、祃韵、慈夜切。\\njí 从纽、铎部;从纽、昔韵、秦昔切。\\n[glyph:g010]¹-[glyph:g011]²-藉-藉\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》24页。2《篆隶表》51页。\\n形声字。从艸,耤声。本义是指古代祭祀或朝聘时陈列礼品的垫物。《说文》:“藉,祭藉也。”《周礼·地官·乡师》:“大祭祀,羞牛牲,共茅藉。”郑玄注:“郑大夫读藉为藉,谓祭前藉也。《易》曰:‘藉用白茅,无咎。’……此所以承祭,既祭,羞束而去之。”《礼记·曲礼下》:“执玉,其有藉者则裼,无藉者则袭。”郑玄注:“藉,藻也。”孔颖达疏:“凡执玉之时,必有其藻以承于玉。”以上读jiè。又可指杂乱,烦杂。《说文》:“藉,一日艸不编,狼藉。”以上读jí。(白于蓝)\\n51\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"小篆「糞」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"汉隶「糞」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"战国文字「藥」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"小篆「藥」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"汉隶「藥」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"小篆「蓆」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"小篆「艾」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉隶「艾」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"小篆「荐」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"小篆「藉」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"汉隶「藉」字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0063/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n85:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000085\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 85, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"5981a1831d360a6f9181a96c035ea6f3ecfdc0696d01418cad4cc20260d2ef26\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"c824283223bae274de7e671f3273aaddce91f8006547d2c254424c614e254844\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"牢 牴 牷 犀 韧 物 犧 犍 犛\\n\\n1《金文编》55页。2《古玺》21页。3《说文》30页。4、6《甲金篆》71页。5《银雀山》37页。\\n形声字。从牛,尾声。其本义指犀牛。《说文》:“犀,南徼外牛,一角在鼻,一角在顶,似豕。”《墨子·公输》:“荆有云梦,犀兕麋鹿满之。”用其本义。又由犀牛角本身之特征引申出犀利、坚固等义。金文和战国玺印中用为姓氏。(陈英杰)\\n\\n韧 rèn 日纽、文部;日纽、震韵、而振切。\\n[glyph:g001]¹—韧\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》30页。\\n形声字。从牛,刃声。其本义应是指牛肥大。元戴侗《六书故·动物一》:“韧,牛充腼(tú 肥壮)也。”《说文》云“韧,韧满也”,当由“牛充腼”引申而来。文献中多用此义。《诗·大雅·灵台》:“王在灵沼,於韧鱼跃。”毛传:“韧,满也。”(陈英杰)\\n\\n物 wù 明纽、物部;微纽、物韵、文弗切。\\n[glyph:g002]¹ 商\\n[glyph:g003]² 商\\n[glyph:g004]³ 秦\\n[glyph:g005]⁴ 秦\\n[glyph:g006]⁵ 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g007]⁶ 汉\\n—物 楷书\\n1、2《甲文编》37页。3、4《睡甲》13页。5《说文》30页。6《马王堆》43页。\\n形声字。从牛,勿声。其本义指杂色牛。《戬》6.7:“丙申卜,行贞:父丁岁物,在五月。”(岁,祭名)即用本义。《诗·小雅·无羊》:“三十维物,而牲则具。”毛传:“异毛色者三十也。”引申指牲畜的种类、品级。《周礼·地官·牧人》:“牧人掌牧六牲,而阜蕃其物,以共祭祀之牲牷。”孙诒让正义:“物犹言种类也……凡牲畜,区别毛色,各为种类,通谓之物。”亦引申指形色。《周礼·春官·保章氏》:“以五云之物,辨吉凶水旱降丰荒之祲象。”郑玄注:“物,色也。视日旁云气之色……知水旱所下之国。”凡事物各指其形色,因之引申指万物。以形色来观察、区别事物,因而又引申出物色、观察义。通过观察鉴别事物有所去取,因而又引申出选择义。秦汉简帛中均用为“万物”义,睡虎地秦简《效》44:“物之不能相易者。”马王堆汉墓帛书《老子》甲本084:“万物草木之生也柔脆。”(陈英杰)\\n\\n犧(牺) xī 晓纽、歌部;晓纽、支韵、许羁切。\\n[glyph:g008]¹ 战国\\n[glyph:g009]² 汉\\n[glyph:g010]⁴ 汉\\n[glyph:g011]³ 《说文》小篆\\n—犧 楷书\\n—牺 楷书\\n1《包山》15页。2《汉印徵》卷2,4页。3《说文》30页。4《甲金篆》72页。\\n形声字。从牛,羲声。战国《诅楚文》、秦驷祷病玉版中借“羲”字为之,羲从兮、羲声。包山简中加义符牛,从羲声,汉印承之。其本义指供宗庙祭祀用的纯色牲。《说文》:“犧,宗庙之牲也。”《六书故·动物一》:“凡畜之牡,毛羽纯具者,牺也。”《书·微子》:“今殷民乃攘窃神祗之牺牷牲。”孔传:“色纯曰牺,体完曰牷,牛、羊、豕曰牲。”《吕氏春秋·行论》:“宋公肉袒执牺。”高诱注:“牺,牲也。”引申泛指用于宗庙祭祀之牲畜。本义今已不用,字只在“牺牲”一语中使用,但已不再指祭牲,而指舍弃义,特指为正义事业献身。“牺”是新创造的形声字,把“犧”笔画、结构都比较繁复的声符改为简单易写的声符。(陈英杰)\\n\\n犍 jiān 见纽、元部;见纽、元韵、居言切。\\nqián 群纽、元部;群纽、仙韵、渠焉切。\\n[glyph:g012]¹ 《说文》新附\\n—犍 楷书\\n1《说文》30页。\\n形声字。从牛,建声。本义指阉过的牛。《玉篇·牛部》:“犍,辖(jiè)也。”《说文》:“犍,辖牛也。”今天有的方言中(如河北清河方言)仍称公牛为犍牛,称公马为骗马。或用同“剧”,阉割义。唐玄应《一切经音义》卷十一引《通俗文》:“以刀去阴曰劇也。”《广韵·元韵》:“劇,以刀去牛势。或作犍。”犍、劇乃异体字。以上诸义读为 jiān。或用为郡名,汉时置“犍为郡”,音读 qián。(陈英杰)\\n\\n犛 部\\n\\n犛 lái 来纽、之部;来纽、咍韵、落哀切。\\nmáo 莫交切。\\nlí 里之切。\\n\\n73\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“韧”字，左牛右刃\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“物”字构型1\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“物”字构型2\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"秦代简帛“物”字构型1\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"秦代简帛“物”字构型2\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“物”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书/印文“物”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"战国包山楚简“犧”字，从牛羲声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"汉印“犧”字构型1\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"汉代“犧”字构型2\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“犧”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》新附小篆“犍”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0085/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n87:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000087\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 87, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"8e03aa9818392e353942debcd274a96e32e4c10f785e0abde042d038191113e9\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"66cde12a03030807be6f8b3416de7aa1fcb0faaf69721b52d3f6abdd9308e643\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"氂 告 譽 口 囑 喙 吻 喉 噲\\n\\n口 部\\n\\n口 kǒu 溪组、侯部；溪组、厚韵、苦后切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001] 商 1\\n[glyph:g002] 商 2\\n[glyph:g003] 西周 3\\n[glyph:g004] 战国 4\\n[glyph:g005] 《说文》小篆 5\\n[glyph:g006] 秦 6\\n[glyph:g007] 汉 7\\n[glyph:g008] 战国 8\\n[glyph:g009] 战国 9\\n口 楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲文编》39页。3《金文编》57页。4《古玺》22页。5《说文》30页。6《睡乙》26页。7《马王堆》45页。8《说文》古文偏旁，见32页君字。9《甲金篆》73页。\\n象形字。字像人口之形。本义即指口。《乙》1463：“贞：疾口？”《诗·豳风·鸱鸮》“予手拮据……予口卒瘏”（瘏，病也），也用其本义。金文中“口”字用作族氏文字。古文字中“口”一般写作两笔，至汉时可能出现了作三笔写的，但笔顺与现在不同，其顺序可能是[glyph:g010]或[glyph:g011]。（陈英杰）\\n\\n囑 zhòu 端组、侯部；端组、侯韵、都豆切。\\nzhuó 端组、屋部；知组、觉韵、竹角切。\\n\\n[glyph:g012] 《说文》小篆 1\\n[glyph:g013] 汉 2\\n囑 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》30页。2《甲金篆》73页。\\n形声字。从口，蜀声。本义指鸟嘴。字亦作咪。《玉篇·口部》：“咪，同囑。”《诗·曹风·候人》：“维鹈在梁，不濡其咪。”毛传：“咪，喙也。”《玉篇·口部》引作“不濡其囑”。此义读作zhòu。字或用同“啄”。《战国策·楚策四》：“黄雀因是以俯囑白粒，仰栖茂树，鼓翅奋翼。”音读zhuó。（陈英杰）\\n\\n喙 huì 晓组、月部；晓组、废韵、许秽切。\\n\\n[glyph:g014] 《说文》小篆 1\\n[glyph:g015] 汉 2\\n[glyph:g016] 汉 3\\n[glyph:g017] 汉 4\\n[glyph:g018] 汉 5\\n[glyph:g019] 汉 6\\n喙 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》30页。2、6《甲金篆》73页。3《汉印徵》卷2，4页。4、5《银雀山》38页。\\n形声字。从口，彖声。《说文》：“喙，口也。”朱骏声通训定声：“兽虫之口曰喙。”《左传·昭公四年》：“顾而见人，黑而上偻(驼背)，深目而猥喙(猪嘴)。”亦引申指人的口。《庄子·秋水》：“今吾无所开吾喙，敢问其方。”成玄英疏：“喙，口也。”《集韵·候韵》：“囑，或作喙。”丁候切，当是因喙与囑义同而换读囑音。甲骨文有一从口从豕之字作[glyph:g020]，乃豕名，非喙字。（陈英杰）\\n\\n吻 wěn 明组、物部；微组、物韵、武粉切。\\n\\n[glyph:g021] 《说文》小篆 1\\n[glyph:g022] 《说文》或体 2\\n[glyph:g023] 秦 3\\n吻 楷书\\n\\n1、2《说文》30页。3《睡乙》28页。\\n形声字。从口，勿声。本义指嘴唇。《说文》：“吻，口边也。”《周礼·考工记·梓人》：“锐喙决吻。”郑玄注：“吻，口腃也。”（《集韵·仙韵》：“腃，吻也。”）现在所说的“接吻”仍用本义。由嘴唇义的名词用法引申出动词用法，指用嘴唇去接触人或物以表示爱的感情，是现代汉语中产生的。（陈英杰）\\n\\n喉 hóu 匣组、侯部；匣组、侯韵、户钩切。\\n\\n[glyph:g024] 《说文》小篆 1\\n[glyph:g025] 汉 2\\n[glyph:g026] 楷书\\n喉 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》30页。2《甲金篆》74页。\\n形声字。从口，侯声。其本义即现在口语所说的“喉咙”，是人和陆栖脊椎动物呼吸道的前(上)端部分，上通咽，下接气管，兼有通气和发音的功能。或包括咽，统称“咽喉”，亦即“喉咙”。《庄子·大宗师》：“真人之息以踵，众人之息以喉。”（陈英杰）\\n\\n噲（浍） kuài 溪组、月部；溪组、夬韵、苦夬切。\\n\\n75\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“口”字，作上宽下尖微敞口形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“口”字，带下尖角\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"西周金文“口”字，下部圆弧形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"战国古文字“口”字，扁平底弧形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“口”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"秦简文字“口”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉代简帛文字“口”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"战国古文“口”字偏旁，倒三角弧形（8号）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"战国古文“口”字偏旁，倒三角尖弧形（9号）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"笔画顺序示意符号：折笔后横竖\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"笔画顺序示意符号：先折后横横等笔顺示意\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“囑”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代文字“囑”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“喙”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"汉印文字“喙”字（2号）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"汉印文字“喙”字（3号）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"银雀山汉简“喙”字（4号）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"银雀山汉简“喙”字（5号）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"《甲金篆》汉代“喙”字（6号）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"甲骨文从口从豕之字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“吻”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"《说文》或体“吻”字，从口从昜\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"秦简文字“吻”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“喉”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g025\", \"description\": \"汉代文字“喉”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g026\", \"description\": \"异体楷书“喉”字，右边侯字上方少一撇点\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0087/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n88:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000088\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 88, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"aab8d939eab8f1139acd0d22ae2ecc7cd5c9e7d8f32a78b16fd0cf28d62d5455\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"f5d9fdb44875220be4b5c9e73790f12bad6245de051a7bc13c2b29f48fec2782\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"口部\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹ 嚼² 噲 — 哙\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n1《说文》30页。2《汉印徵》卷2, 4页。\\n形声字。从口, 會声。其本义为吞咽。《说文》: “噲, 咽也。”王筠句读: “此下咽之咽。”一说指动物的嘴。《说文》: “噲, 一曰嚏噲也。”又: “嚏, 一曰喙也。”文献中字或通“快”, 快意、称心义。《淮南子·精神》: “当此之时, 噲然而卧, 则亲戚兄弟欢然而喜。”“会”是會草书楷化字, 哙是由会类推简化而成的。(陈英杰)\\n\\n呑 tūn 透组、真部; 透组、痕韵、吐根切。\\n[glyph:g002]¹ [glyph:g003]² [glyph:g004]³ 呑\\n《说文》小篆 汉 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》30页。2《马王堆》46页。3《甲金篆》74页。\\n形声字。从口, 天声。本义为咽下。《庄子·庚桑楚》: “吞舟之鱼, 砀而失水, 则蚁能苦之。”马王堆帛书《五十二病方》259: “而吞之。”引申为吞并、消灭义。《管子·霸形》: “楚欲吞宋、郑。”(陈英杰)\\n\\n咽 yān 影组、真部; 影组、先韵、乌前切。\\nyàn 影组、真部; 影组、霰韵、於甸切。\\nyè 影组、屑韵、乌结切。\\n[glyph:g005]¹ [glyph:g006]² 咽\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《说文》30页。2《马王堆》49页。\\n形声字。从口, 因声。本义指咽喉。咽是消化和呼吸的通道, 位于鼻腔、口腔的后方, 喉的上方, 分为鼻咽、口咽和喉咽三部分, 通称咽喉。《汉书·息夫躬传》: “吏就问, 云咽已绝, 血从鼻耳出。”颜师古注: “咽, 喉咙。”咽乃气所流通, 扼要之处也, 因以引申指形势险要之地。用为以上诸义时读 yān。由本义引申出吞食、吞咽义, 读 yàn。由吞食义引申出食塞义, 同“噎”。由食塞义引申出声塞义, 指声音呜咽、悲咽、幽咽, 形容其悲哀之声, 用为此类意义读 yè。(陈英杰)\\n\\n嗌 yì 影组、锡部; 影组、昔韵、伊昔切。\\n[glyph:g007]¹ [glyph:g008]² [glyph:g009]³ [glyph:g010]⁴ [glyph:g011]⁵ [glyph:g012]⁶ 嗌\\n西周 战国 战国 《说文》籀文 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n1《金文编》1281页。2、3《战文编》64页。4、5《说文》30页。6《马王堆》51页。\\n形声字。从口, 益声。本义指咽喉。《谷梁传·昭公十九年》: “哭泣歠(啜)钎粥, 嗌不容粒。”马王堆帛书《阴阳十一脉灸经》甲本: “嗌肿。”引申指交通要道, 隘与嗌是同源词。嗌字在西周、战国文字中均作象形写法, 西周金文作[glyph:g013], 战国文字中作[glyph:g014](郭店楚简《语丛三》16号简), 《说文》籀文作[glyph:g015]。许慎云: “上象口, 下象颈脉理也。”此象形写法《金文编》列入附录下(662号), 作为不识字处理。此字西周金文中作人名, 如《集成》1961 嗌鼎、《集成》2838 曶鼎等; 或表赏赐义, 如《集成》4130 敖叔微簋盖“嗌贝十朋”, 或读“益”, 或读“赐”。形声写法小篆始见, 当晚出。(陈英杰)\\n\\n哆 chǐ 昌组、歌部; 昌组、纸韵、尺氏切。\\nduō\\n[glyph:g016]¹ [glyph:g017]² 哆\\n战国 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《甲金篆》74页。2《说文》30页。\\n形声字。从口, 多声。本义指张大嘴。《说文》: “哆, 张口也。”《诗·小雅·巷伯》: “哆兮侈兮, 成是南箕(张大嘴就像是挂在南天的箕星)。”用其本义, 读 chǐ。今用为“哆嗦”, 字读 duō。张口之“哆”与哆嗦之“哆”是同形字。(陈英杰)\\n\\n呱 gū 见组、鱼部; 见组、模韵、古胡切。\\nguā\\nguǎ\\n[glyph:g018]¹ 呱\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》30页。\\n形声字。从口, 瓜声。本义指小儿的哭声。《书·皋陶谟》: “启呱呱而泣。”用为此义读 gū。现在表达此义的字是“哇”, 指小儿哇哇的哭, 是一象声词。今此字仍用为象声词, 如狗赶鸭子呱呱叫、咭哩呱啦等, 读为 guā。今天在某些方言中有“拉呱”语, 义指讲故事、聊天、谈闲话等, 读 guǎ。(陈英杰)\\n\\n76\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0088/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0088/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0088/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\":