alin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0275/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g027\", \"description\": \"“敘”字甲骨文字形1（商）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0275/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g028\", \"description\": \"“敘”字战国文字形2\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0275/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g029\", \"description\": \"“敘”字战国文字形3\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0275/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g030\", \"description\": \"“敘”字战国文字形4\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0275/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g031\", \"description\": \"“敘”字战国文字形5\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0275/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g032\", \"description\": \"“敘”字小篆字形6（《说文》）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0275/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g033\", \"description\": \"“敘”字汉隶字形7\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0275/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n276:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000276\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 276, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"69ac7782a2b7bf2f4f50b437434b99710a97338eab198d19ef84c57310fd38be\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"b93535e7c9f6ecdf440f70536896568d6f440ec76738f5c4d44ddebe7cb11071\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"支部 教部\\n\\n且表音,敘与余皆鱼部。敘字在战国时的主要变化:一是形旁又变作攴,属于形义皆近偏旁的更易,不影响本义表达;二是声旁余加饰笔,由原来的[glyph:g001]而作[glyph:g002]、[glyph:g003]、[glyph:g004],甚或加构件或饰图[glyph:g005]。《说文》肯定了战国从攴余声的结构,隶变后楷书作敘,是小篆笔势变化的结果。现代整理汉字时,以商代从又的叙为正体。本义当是手执针砭被祛病。《殷虚书契前编》6.10.3:“不辟(孽),敘?”(疾病不会恶化作孽,用扎针治疗可以吗?)《说文》本义“次第”盖假借义。《书·舜典》:“百揆时敘。”孔颖达正义:“百官于是得其次叙。”又指叙文、叙言,如《说文解字·叙》。此义古亦假“序”为之,如《史记·太史公自序》。通“除”,消除。郭店楚简《尊德义》:“杀戮(戮),所以敘(除)咎(怨)。”敘敩,联绵词,除去。《长沙子弹库楚帛书》10.3:“徵敩不义。”用作族名。《小屯·殷虚文字乙编》7594:“甲用敘来羌?”(甲日用敘族送来的羌人祭祀吗?)(张标)\\n\\n牧 mù 明组、职部;明组、屋韵、莫六切。\\n\\n[glyph:g006]商^7 [glyph:g007]商^8 [glyph:g008]商^9\\n[glyph:g009]商^3 [glyph:g010]商^4\\n[glyph:g011]商^1 [glyph:g012]商^2 [glyph:g013]西周^11 [glyph:g014]西周^12 [glyph:g015]西周^13\\n[glyph:g016]商^5 [glyph:g017]商^6 [glyph:g018]商^10\\n[glyph:g019]战国^14 [glyph:g020]《说文》小篆^15 [glyph:g021]汉^16 [glyph:g022]汉^17 牧楷书\\n\\n1-4、7-11《甲文编》141~142页。5、6《续甲》卷3,30页。11、12、13《金文编》221页。14《战文编》203页。15《说文》69页。16《汉印徵》卷3,22页。17《马王堆》127页。\\n\\n会意兼形声字。从攴,从牛(牛亦声)。形旁攴为手持器械治事状,表示牧的本义与治事有关。形旁兼声旁牛为象形字,表示牧的本义与畜类有关且表音,牛与牧为之职对转。始见于甲骨文,时异体颇多。或从攴从牛,或从攴从羊,或从帚从牛,或从又持帚从牛;或牧(牧)旁复加构件彳(chì)、止、疋等,会牧牛、牧羊、刷洗以牧、牧之于路(彳表道路)、人行以牧(止为脚趾,代表人)、人行于路以牧意。构件的位置或左或右,并不稳定。西周时大量异体被淘汰,仅保留了从攴从牛者,且牛左攴右的布局亦得固定。战国至《说文》沿袭了西周结构,只有《汗简》易攴为女,盖取去棍棒粗暴、取宽松调教以牧意。楷书作牧,主要是笔势变化。本义是放牧。《殷契遗珠》758:“甲戌卜,宾贞:在易牧,隻(获)羌?”引申指牧场、田野。《诗·邶风·静女》:“自牧归荑。”需俟从鼎:“女觅我田牧。”引申指养育、管理。《国语·鲁语上》:“君也者,将牧民而正其邪者也。”云梦秦简《为吏之道》:“施(弛)而息之,乄(密,宁也)而牧之。”引申指掌管山林水泽六畜之官员。同簋:“(同)嗣(司,主管)易(扬)林吴(虞)牧。”甲骨文、金文用作人名。《小屯·殷虚文字乙编》:“牧人(贡纳)十,在渔(地名)。”牧簋:“王乎(呼)内史吴册令(命)牧。”或借“数”为牧,见郭店楚简《穷达以时》“(百里奚)为敀(伯)數牛”。(张标)\\n\\n教部\\n\\n教 jiào 见组、宵部;见组、效韵、古孝切。\\njiāo 见组、宵部;见组、肴韵、古肴切。\\n\\n[glyph:g023]商^1 [glyph:g024]西周^5 [glyph:g025]《说文》古文^7 [glyph:g026]战国^8\\n[glyph:g027]商^2 [glyph:g028]商^3 [glyph:g029]春秋^6 [glyph:g030]战国^9 [glyph:g031]《说文》小篆^13 [glyph:g032]汉^14 [glyph:g033]汉^15 [glyph:g034]汉^16 教楷书\\n[glyph:g035]《说文》古文^12\\n[glyph:g036]商^4 [glyph:g037]战国^10 [glyph:g038]战国^11\\n\\n1-4《甲文编》146页。5、6《金文编》224页。7、12、13《说文》69页。8、11《战文编》211页。9《楚系简帛》278页。10《汉语字形表》127页。14、15、16《篆隶表》220页。\\n\\n形声字。商代甲骨文初作从攴,爻声。形旁攴为手持器械施教形,表示教的本义与施教有关。声旁交像器物交织形,于教字表音,爻与效(教)并为宵部。后盖为突出教育儿童义,复加表意偏旁子,遂为从攴从子爻声之教。商代的效经历西周、战国到汉代始终存在,但不被《说文》收录。主流体教字出现后商代出现爻省声的异体[glyph:g039],此体延续到战国,后不传。战国时主流体教经常省略构件攴作孝(见郭店楚简《老子》甲本)。隶变时构件爻或作夂、\\n\\n264\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/ocr-corrected.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": \"b3ea09f692f9d47939731d7f651db5fac711d82dae0665d53d4cfd48223688f2\", \"correction_provenance\": {\"schema_version\": 1, \"parent_evidence_sha256\": \"b3ea09f692f9d47939731d7f651db5fac711d82dae0665d53d4cfd48223688f2\", \"source_sha256\": \"69ac7782a2b7bf2f4f50b437434b99710a97338eab198d19ef84c57310fd38be\", \"patches\": [{\"start\": 1938, \"end\": 1947, \"before\": \"声旁爻像器物交织形\", \"after\": \"声旁交像器物交织形\", \"reason\": \"The source scan prints 交 in this descriptive phrase; the OCR substituted 爻. The separate phonetic analysis elsewhere remains unchanged.\", \"source_checked\": true, \"reviewers\": [\"root; original page scan inspected 2026-09-30\"]}], \"remove_glyph_ids\": [], \"verification\": \"source_checked_correction_not_edition_approval\", \"corrections_sha256\": \"922da5c80d739ecc5b829053789d566edc1a8c76f93d515c36992d5aea4e69a4\"}, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"古文字“余”形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"古文字“余”加饰笔形式\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"古文字“余”加饰笔形式\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"古文字“余”加饰笔形式\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"古文字“余”加饰图或构件形式\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“牧”字形7\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“牧”字形8\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“牧”字形9\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“牧”字形3\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“牧”字形4\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“牧”字形1\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“牧”字形2\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"西周金文“牧”字形11\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"西周金文“牧”字形12\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"西周金文“牧”字形13\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"商代文字“牧”字形5\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"商代文字“牧”字形6\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"商代文字“牧”字形10\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"战国文字“牧”字形14\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“牧”字形15\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0276/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"汉代文字“牧”字形16\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi