ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0287/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"战国楚简字形盼，从目从分\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0287/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"战国字形盼，从目分声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0287/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆盼字，从目分声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0287/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n293:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000293\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 293, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"708ea9afbfa99103f7657819d9109264e397d7b04b29ee7a4d7c2554e1ab77ed\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"eb97ea7ab5d50acf10efda73af920403be9af3c9ee3c72d4285904f73fb395cd\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_with_unidentified_printed_characters\"}, \"text\": \"瞻 相 瞋 眷 睇 督 看\\n\\n形声字。从目,真声。战国古文字中已见瞋字,时真左目右,《说文》整理为目左真右。《说文》所载异体作[glyph:p001],从目从戊。隶变后楷书分别作瞋、[glyph:p001],通行体为瞋,[glyph:p001]少用。《说文》本义为“张目”,即瞪大眼睛。云梦秦简《语书》:“因恙(佯)瞋目扼捾(腕)以视(示)力。”引申指发怒。《文选·孔稚珪〈北山移文〉》:“丛条瞋胆。”古注训怒。以上读chēn。指盛貌,读tián。同“眏”,视,读tiàn。同“眸”,张目,读shèn。参“真”字条。(张标)\\n\\n眷 juàn 见纽、元部;见纽、线韵、古掾切。\\n[glyph:g001] 1\\n战国\\n[glyph:g002] 2\\n《说文》小篆\\n眷\\n楷书\\n1《四声韵》61页。2《说文》72页。\\n形声字。从目,关(juàn)声。隶变后楷书作眷,形旁目发生的是笔势变化,声旁关发生的是笔意变化。隶变时还曾出现过一些异体,如北魏公孙略墓志作“[glyph:p002]”,南朝齐宋买造象作“[glyph:p003]”,韩叔子造象作“[glyph:p004]”,齐道民马洛子造象作“[glyph:p005]”等,但都没有成为正体。睇见于《玉篇》,《说文》未收。现代整理汉字时,睇作为异体被淘汰,眷保留为正体。《说文》本义是“顾”,指转过头去看顾,《诗·大雅·皇矣》有“乃眷西顾”。引申指朝向、顾念、顾恋、亲眷等,假借为姓氏。(张标)\\n\\n睇 juàn 见纽、元部;见纽、线韵、古掾切。\\n[glyph:g003] 1\\n战国\\n睇\\n楷书\\n1《古文典》1003页。\\n形声字。从目,卷声。睇是眷的异体,它们共同的源头、声音是关,见于春秋古文字。古初以关为卷,后造分化字卷(见“卷”字条)。卷是睇的近源、准声音。初始可能以卷为睇,后造专字睇。故书中曾以卷为“倦”、“圈”、“鬆”、“蜷”、“倦”、“療”“蓉”、“幡”等,马王堆帛书《缪和》“终身不卷”、银雀山汉简“卷病”并用作“倦”,后乃为造分化字。睇字可能也是这样产生;或者由构件目与卷整合而成;或者由声音关为之,后为造分化字;也可能卷字出现后,变易声旁关为卷而成(卷与关并见纽、元部)。《说文》收眷未收睇,《诗》“眷言顾之”、“乃眷西顾”,并亦作睇。今眷为正体,睇被淘汰。(张标)\\n\\n督 dū 端纽、觉部;端纽、沃韵、冬毒切。\\n[glyph:g004] 1\\n战国\\n[glyph:g005] 2\\n《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g006] 3\\n汉\\n督\\n楷书\\n[glyph:g007] 4\\n汉\\n[glyph:g008] 5\\n汉\\n[glyph:g009] 6\\n汉\\n督\\n楷书\\n[glyph:g010] 7\\n汉\\n[glyph:g011] 8\\n汉\\n[glyph:g012] 9\\n汉\\n[glyph:g013] 10\\n汉\\n1《战文编》218页。2《说文》72页。3、9《篆隶表》228页。4、5《汉印徵》卷4,1页。6、7、8、10《隶辨》654页。\\n形声字。从目,叔声。形旁目为眼目之象,表示督的本义与眼目有关。声旁叔是从又、赤声的形声字,于督表音,督与叔并为舌音、觉部。战国古文字中始见督字,时构件“又”作“攴”,《说文》整理作从又(又与攴属于形义皆近之偏旁)。隶变时“又”或作“寸”(寸与又也是形义皆近偏旁),最后楷书还是从又作“督”,是小篆的笔势变化。隶变时“目”或讹作“日”,楷书作“督”,俗体。受草书影响,隶变时构件叔或写作[glyph:g014]、[glyph:g015]、[glyph:g016]等,但没有取得主流地位。汉魏以降,还曾出现过“督”、“督”、“督”、“督”、“督”、“督”、“督”等,并俗体。《说文》本义是察看。《管子·九守》:“修名而督实。”引申指责罚。汉王充《论衡·寒温》:“夫妻相督。”又引申指纠正。《周礼·春官·大祝》:“禁督逆祀命者。”后又引申指监督、统领等。通“笃”,厚重。《左传·僖公十二年》:“余嘉乃勋,应乃懿德,谓督不忘。”通“毒”、“竺”,印度古译称“天督”、“天竺”、“身毒”。(张标)\\n\\n看 kàn 溪纽、元部;溪纽、翰韵、苦旰切。\\nkān 溪纽、元部;溪纽、寒韵、苦寒切。\\n[glyph:g017] 1\\n《说文》小篆\\n看\\n楷书\\n1《说文》72页。\\n会意字。《说文》分析为“从手下目”。表意偏旁手与目皆象形字,以目在手下会看视意。看之初文为形声字[glyph:p006],战国文字作[glyph:p007],《说文》误作会意(参“幹”字条)。楷书作看,主要是小篆的笔势变化。《说文》本义是“睇”,即以目视物。《乐府诗集·横吹曲辞五·十五从军征》:“遥\\n\\n281\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"p001\", \"description\": \"Printed variant of 瞋, composed of 目 and 戌 (left 目, right 戌)\", \"kind\": \"unidentified_printed_character\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"Historical Warring States character form for 眷 (label 1)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"Historical Shuowen seal script form for 眷 (label 2)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"p002\", \"description\": \"Printed variant of 眷 with 目 and specific variant components\", \"kind\": \"unidentified_printed_character\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"p003\", \"description\": \"Printed variant of 眷 with 目 and variant top components\", \"kind\": \"unidentified_printed_character\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"p004\", \"description\": \"Printed variant of 眷 with 目 and other strokes\", \"kind\": \"unidentified_printed_character\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"p005\", \"description\": \"Printed variant of 眷 with 目 and specific variant components\", \"kind\": \"unidentified_printed_character\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"Historical Warring States character form for 睇 (label 1)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"Historical Warring States character form for 督 (label 1)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0293/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"Historical Shuowen seal script form for 督 (label 2)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"p