torical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文‘眉’字第1形，人/女形目上有眉\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文‘眉’字第2形，目上有眉毛及额理\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"西周金文‘眉’字第3形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"西周金文‘眉’字第4形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"西周金文‘眉’字第5形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"战国文字‘眉’字第6形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"战国文字‘眉’字第7形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘眉’字第8形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘眉’字第9形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘眉’字第10形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘眉’字第11形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g025\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书‘眉’字第12形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g026\", \"description\": \"古文字眉毛带额理构形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g027\", \"description\": \"古文字眉毛简略构形之一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g028\", \"description\": \"古文字眉毛简略构形之二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g029\", \"description\": \"西周金文‘眉’额理偏旁构形之一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0299/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g030\", \"description\": \"西周金文‘眉’额理偏旁构形之二\", \"kind\": \"historical