l}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"汉印廄字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0836/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n846:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000846\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 846, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"0c406109f14d6811ad87d5ab26cdbee2cd02db968c6940d4bbb777873adff05e\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"0c6e03dca350ae94be99d1ec73b630a60a1ad4512f26cbb52281a5b2939f9944\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"仄 厥 厂 丸 咼 危 𠤲 石\\n\\n灵公不君,厚敛以雕墙,从台上弹人,而观其辟丸也。”《庄子·达生》:“五六月,累丸二而不坠,则失者锱铢;累三而不坠,则失者十一;累五而不坠,犹掇之也。”引申为卵,指禽鸟类所生的蛋。《吕氏春秋·本味》:“流沙之西,丹山之南,有凤之丸。”又可用作动词,抟成丸形。《晋书·陈寿传》:“遭父丧,有疾,使婢丸药。客往见之,乡党以为贬议。”(孟蓬生)\\n\\n咼 wō 影组、歌部;影组、戈韵、乌禾切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹—咼\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》194页。\\n形声字。从丸,咼声。一些鸟类(如猫头鹰)猎食后吐出的丸形物,主要成份是被猎食动物的皮毛等不容易消化的东西。《说文》:“咼,鸷鸟食己,吐其皮毛如丸。”(孟蓬生)\\n\\n危部\\n\\n危 wēi 疑组、微部;疑组、支韵、鱼为切。\\n\\n[glyph:g002]¹—[glyph:g003]²—[glyph:g004]³—[glyph:g005]⁴—[glyph:g006]⁵—危\\n战国 秦 汉 汉 汉 楷书\\n[glyph:g007]⁶\\n《说文》小篆\\n1《汗简》194页。2《古陶》437页。3、4《马王堆》386页。5《隶辨》43页。6《说文》194页。\\n形声字。从卩,𠤕声。卩字本像一跪跽人形,所以危当即跪字的初文或异构。《韩非子·外储说左下》:“朗危引之而逃之门下室中。”正用危如跪字。但典籍中跪多表跪跽,而危则多表示高或危险,已经分化为两个字。表示危高和危险的字当以𠤕为本字,见前“𠤕”字条。《庄子·盗跖》:“使子路去其危冠,解其长剑。”陆德明释文:“危冠,李云:‘危,高也。’”《礼记·缁衣》:“则民言不危行,行不危言。”郑玄注:“危,犹高也。言不高于行,行不高于是言,言行相应也。”以上为危高义。《左传·昭公十八年》:“小国忘守则危,况有灾乎?”《韩非子·十过》:“故曹,小国也,而迫于晋楚之间,其君之危,犹累卵也。”以上为危险义。(孟蓬生)\\n\\n𠤲\\nqí 溪组、支部;溪组、支韵、去奇切。\\njì 见组、支部;见组、寘韵、诡伪切。\\n\\n[glyph:g008]¹—𠤲\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n1《说文》194页。\\n形声字。从危,支声。本义为倾斜不正。敧區,即崎岖,倾斜不正。北周庾信《小园赋》:“𠤲區兮狭室,穿漏兮茅茨。”(孟蓬生)\\n\\n石部\\n\\n石 shí 禅组、铎部;禅组、昔韵、常只切。\\n\\n[glyph:g009]¹ [glyph:g010]³ [glyph:g011]⁵ [glyph:g012]⁶ [glyph:g013]⁷ [glyph:g014]¹⁰ 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g015]¹¹—[glyph:g016]¹²—石\\n商 商 西周 春秋 战国 秦 汉 楷书\\n[glyph:g017]² [glyph:g018]⁴ [glyph:g019]⁸—[glyph:g020]¹³\\n商 商 战国 汉\\n[glyph:g021]⁹—[glyph:g022]¹⁴\\n战国 汉\\n\\n1、2《甲文编》384页。3、4《甲文编》385页。5、6《金文编》664页。7《古玺》237页。8、9《郭店》132页。10《说文》194页。11《睡甲》148页。12《篆隶表》665页。13、14《隶辨》731页。\\n“[glyph:g023](厂)”与“石”本为一字之分化,参见前“厂”字条。“[glyph:g023](厂)”为象形字,像山石形。后来加装饰偏旁“口”字,便成为“石”。战国文字则在“厂”的上下添加饰笔,成为[glyph:g024]、[glyph:g025]等形,这种加饰笔的字形在汉代碑刻中还有所保留,古代字书中也还收有这种加饰笔的隶定字形,如《集韵》石字古文作“[glyph:g026]”。秦代以后,石所从的“口”字变成[glyph:g027],作圆廓形,以至于《说文》以为该构件像石形。石字本义为岩石。《诗·小雅·鹤鸣》:“它山之石,可以攻玉。”特指石磬。《书·尧典》:“予击石拊石,百兽率舞。”孔传:“石,磬也。”亦特指古人用以治病的石针。《战国策·秦策二》:“扁鹊怒而投其石。”高诱注:“石,砭,所以砭弹人臃肿也。”又引申为用石针治病。《素问·腹中论》:“灸之则瘖,石之则狂。”林亿注:“石,谓以石\\n\\n833\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"小篆《说文》中的“咼”字，左为丸，右为咼\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"战国《汗简》危字，从𠤕从卩\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"秦代《古陶》危字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"汉代《马王堆》危字(其一)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"汉代《马王堆》危字(其二)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"汉代《隶辨》危字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"小篆《说文》危字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"小篆《说文》𠤲字，从危从支\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"商代《甲文编》石字(序号1)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"商代《甲文编》石字(序号3)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"西周《金文编》石字(序号5)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"春秋《金文编》石字(序号6)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"战国《古玺》石字(序号7)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"小篆《说文》石字(序号10)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0846/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"秦代《睡甲》石字(序号11)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-