/page-0886/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"楷书“冤”字演变示意字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0886/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"p001\", \"description\": \"印刷体异体字：宝盖头（宀）下从兔\", \"kind\": \"unidentified_printed_character\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0886/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"p002\", \"description\": \"印刷体异体字：宝盖头（宀）或秃宝盖（冖）下从免\", \"kind\": \"unidentified_printed_character\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0886/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [\"在讨论'兔'字三种楷书异体时，原书正文印出的异体字形与'冤'字下方的楷书异体字形存在特异构形，分别用字形描述或glyph引用记录\"], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n890:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000890\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 890, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"7d8d75364190cf96c59c1cf5c3d7952233da054a4f8aed95256715a84a945c82\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"24dd068bc5b4a3d7a36564fab9b17547124b7db2929f2211fcfa0dd1a6ddd744\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_with_unidentified_printed_characters\"}, \"text\": \"猲 獪 獫 猗 昊 默 猝 猩 猥 獎\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹ 一 [glyph:g002]² 一 昊\\n秦 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n\\n1《战文编》665页。2《说文》204页。\\n\\n会意字。从犬，从目，会狗目视物之意。本义为犬张目凝视的样子。《说文》：“昊，犬视貌(貌)。”《玉篇·犬部》：“昊，犬视也。”“昊”不局限于犬，《尔雅·释兽》：“鸟曰昊。”郭璞注：“张两翅。”郝懿行义疏：“昊者，张目视也。鸟之休息，恒张两翅，瞪目直视。”“昊”还可用来指一种猿属兽。《广韵·锡韵》：“昊，兽名。猿属，唇厚而碧色。”(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n猩 xīng 心纽、耕部；心纽、青韵、桑经切。\\n\\n[glyph:g003]¹ 一 猩\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》204页。\\n\\n形声字。从犬，星声。据《说文》，本义为狗的吠叫声。《说文》：“猩，猩猩，犬吠声。”有人认为，“猩猩”不仅犬吠声，应在“犬吠声”之前加上“一日”。即认为“猩”即指“猩猩”，而又有一种说法是“猩”为狗叫声。《礼记·曲礼上》：“猩猩能言，不离禽兽。”《玉篇·犬部》：“猩，猩猩，如狗，面似人也。”《吕氏春秋·本味》：“肉之美者：猩猩之唇。”高诱注：“猩猩，兽名也，人面狗躯而长尾。”这可以解释“猩”字从“犬”的缘由。据一种未经验证的说法(一般只是俗语源的说法)，猩猩的血呈鲜红色，故“猩色”又借指鲜红色。唐韩偓《已凉》：“碧阑干外绣帘垂，猩色屏风画折枝。”今多“猩红”连用。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n默 mò 明纽、职部；明纽、德韵、莫北切。\\n\\n[glyph:g004]¹ 一 [glyph:g005]² 一 [glyph:g006]³ 一 默\\n《说文》小篆 汉 晋 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》204页。2、3《甲金篆》680页。\\n\\n形声字，从犬，黑声。本义指犬暗中追赶人。《说文》：“默，犬暂逐人也。从犬，黑声。读若墨。”这个“暂”是突然的意思。清沈涛《说文古本考》指出：“‘暂’字乃‘潜’字之误。”按他的说法，则是指的暗中追赶，静不作声，由此泛化，可指暗中做事或沉默不语。《易·系辞上》：“或出或处，或默或语。”(或者入世，或者隐居，或者沉默不语，或者高谈阔论)《史记·刺客列传》：“荆轲嘿而逃去。”字作“嘿”，同“默”，在这里不读hēi。由沉默不语引申指默写等，已是很晚才出现的用法。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n猥 wěi 影纽、微部；影纽、贿韵、乌贿切。\\n\\n[glyph:g007]¹ 一 [glyph:g008]² 一 猥\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》204页。2《甲金篆》680页。\\n\\n形声字。从犬，畏声。本义为犬吠声。《说文》：“猥，犬吠声。”《广韵·贿韵》：“猥，犬声。”在古文献中未见作为“犬(吠)声”使用的“猥”字之例，而是多用为众多、繁杂等义。《管子·八观》：“以人猥计其野，草田多而辟田少者，虽不水旱，饥国之野也。”唐人注：“猥，众也。以人之多少计其野之广狭也。”由众多、繁杂等义又引申表示鄙陋、卑贱。还可用作谦词，相当于“辱”、“承”。“猥”又为兽名，也作“猬”，现代汉字整理时，将这一意义的“猥”作为“猬”的异体字淘汰。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n猝 cù 清纽、物部；清纽、没韵、仓没切。\\n\\n[glyph:g009]¹ 一 猝\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》204页。\\n\\n形声字。从犬，卒声。本义为狗突然蹿出追赶人。《说文》：“猝，犬从艸(草)暴出逐人也。”暴出，突然蹿出。由本义引申为仓促、匆忙。《资治通鉴·齐明帝永泰元年》：“县丁猝不可集。”由仓促、匆忙引申为突然、忽然、意想不到。金董解元《西厢记诸宫调》卷六：“张生猝病，(红娘)与莺往视疾。”“猝”字各义，在古文献中每有写作“卒”的，这是需要注意的一个问题。“猝”字构词，如“猝不及防”、“猝迫”、“猝急”等，可以提示“猝”字的用法和意义，这是需要注意的另一个问题。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n[glyph:p001] jiǎng 精纽、阳部；精纽、养韵、即两切。\\n\\n[glyph:g010]¹ 一 [glyph:p001] 一 奬 一 奖\\n《说文》小篆 楷书 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》204页。\\n\\n形声字。从犬，将省声。本义为驱狗劝使猛进，“奖”本字。《说文》：“[glyph:p001]，嗾犬厉之也。从犬，将省声。”段玉\\n\\n875\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"秦代秦文字小篆形，左犬右目结构\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆昊字，左犬右目结构\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆猩字，左犬右星结构\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆默字，左犬右黑结构\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书/篆文默字，左犬右黑结构\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"晋代字形默字，左犬右黑结构\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆猥字，左犬右畏结构\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代字形猥字，左犬右畏结构\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆猝字，左犬右卒结构\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"p001\", \"description\": \"由左爿右上月右下犬构成的‘奖’的异体字/本字（或作从爿从犬从月/肉）\", \"kind\": \"unidentified_printed_character\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆‘奖’字本字，左将省右犬结构\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0890/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [\"p001 represents the historic standard form of 獎/奖 with components 爿, 肉/月, and 犬 (often represented as ⿰爿⿱月犬 or 𤟤/獎 variations); due to precise unicode rendering/canonical variance, it is referenced as an unidentified printed character.\"], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n902:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000902\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 902, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"228d38fcdc0f14029eda6fa32872da7b270fc48cbc1bf355d031e70e1424e7bb\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"d7b64f4941c69c9abe4fb10a8740db82a6ea115c26e677dcdffd7d611aace43e\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"燹 煖 寮 然 蘄 燔 燒 烈\\n\\n“犬”,下为“火”。就构形取意而言,有一种直观通俗的理解,认为以“火”烧“犬”之“肉”即为“然”(燃)。后来为了形体结构平整,位于下部的火形演变成“灬”。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n熱 ruò 日组、月部;日组、薛韵、如劣切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹ 商 [glyph:g002]² 商 [glyph:g003]³ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g004] 楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲骨文字典》743页。3《说文》207页。\\n\\n形声字。从火,埶声。本义为燃烧。《说文》:“熱,烧也。”徐铉:“《说文》无热字。当从火、从艸,热省声。”《左传·昭公二十七年》:“将师退,遂令攻邰氏,且熱之。”杜预注:“熱,烧也。”《淮南子·兵略》:“毋熱五谷,毋焚积聚。”由焚烧义引申为烘烤义。甲骨文字形从“丮”(人跽而双手有所握持)执火炬之形,“丮”或作“又”(像手形),为会意字;小篆演变成上“埶”、下“火”的形声字;楷书由小篆演变而来,写作“熱”。“熱”音义与“燃”相类,为同源字。“熱”字是否可以分析为从艸、从熱、熱亦声的会意兼形声字,并解释其本义为放火烧荒呢?难以确定。因为这最多只是假设,必须进一步严加考证后才能下结论。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n燔 fán 并组、元部;奉组、元韵、附袁切。\\n\\n[glyph:g005]¹ 战国 [glyph:g006]² 秦 [glyph:g007]³ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g008]⁴ 汉 [glyph:g009]⁵ 汉 [glyph:g010] 楷书\\n\\n1、2、4、5《甲金篆》692页。3《说文》207页。\\n\\n形声字。从火,番声。本义为焚烧。《说文》:“燔,熱(ruò)也。”《庄子·盗跖》:“文公后背之,(介)子推怒而去,抱木而燔死。”马王堆汉墓帛书《五十二病方》:“燔死人头皆治。”由焚烧引申为烤、炙。宋陆游《鹅湖夜坐书怀》:“马鞍挂狐兔,燔炙百步香。”“燔”在古代还常用作“燔”的通假字,指古代祭祀用的烤肉。《孟子·告子下》:“孔子为鲁司寇,不用,从而祭,燔肉不至,不税(脱)冕而行。”“燔”的古今字形无大变化,需要注意的是,“燔”右上部分并非采摘的“采”。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n燒(烧) shāo 书组、宵部;书组、宵韵、式招切。\\nshào 书组、宵部;书组、笑韵、失照切。\\n\\n[glyph:g011]¹ 秦 [glyph:g012]² 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g013]³ 汉 [glyph:g014] 楷书 [glyph:g015] 楷书\\n\\n1、3《甲金篆》692页。2《说文》207页。\\n\\n形声字。从火,堯声,读为shāo。本义为使物体着火。《说文》:“燒,熱(ruò)也。”《战国策·齐策四》:“臣窃矫君命,以责(债)赐诸民,因烧其券,民称万岁。”由使着火义引申为加热使物体起变化、烘烤、一种烹饪方法等义,由加热引申为因病而体温升高,由使物体起变化引申为因肥料过浓使植物枯萎或死亡,现代又可喻指人因财富多而头脑发热、得意忘形。“燒”又读shào,意为放火烧野草以肥田。《管子·轻重甲》:“齐之北泽烧,火光照堂下。”也泛指野火。字义系统往往是通过比况式联想类推而丰富发展起来的,“烧”的字义系统是这方面的一个典型范例。“烧”原作左“火”、右“堯”,后“堯”据草书简化成“尧”,“燒”也就类推简化成“烧”。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n烈 liè 来组、月部;来组、薛韵、良薛切。\\n\\n[glyph:g016]¹ 西周 [glyph:g017]² 春秋 [glyph:g018]³ 《说文》小篆 [glyph:g019]⁴ 汉 [glyph:g020]⁵ 汉 [glyph:g021]⁶ 汉 [glyph:g022] 楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲骨文字典》743页。3、4《说文》207页。5、6《甲金篆》692页。\\n\\n形声字。从火,列声。本义为火势猛烈。《说文》:“烈,火猛也。”《左传·昭公二十年》:“夫火烈,民望而畏之,故鲜死也。”泛指猛烈。由猛烈引申为强烈、激烈、严厉、浓烈、浓重、威武、威力、刚直、坚贞等义。由火势猛烈可引申为光明、辉煌义。也可引申指功业、事业。金文从柬(或“束”)、从刀,对应于刺(là)字,其实也可以看作是“列”(裂)的一个会意本字。“柬”有分义,变形为“束”,从“刀”以判之。一般认为,文例中借为“烈”字。(注意:金文“刺”字多释为“烈”,如西周中期𧽒簋:“对扬父母福利(烈)。”西周晚期南宫柳鼎:“对扬天子休,用乍(作)朕刺(烈)考尊鼎。”但这不意味着没有释为“列”的可能。)小篆“烈”字从火、列声,隶楷文字由小篆演变而来。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n887\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文字形“熱”，从丮执火或又执火形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文字形“熱”，异体，手持火炬形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“熱”字，上埶下火\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"楷书繁体“熱”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"战国文字“燔”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"秦代文字“燔”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“燔”字，左火右番\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“燔”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“燔”字异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"楷书“燔”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"秦代文字“燒”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“燒”字，左火右堯\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“燒”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"楷书繁体“燒”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"楷书简体“烧”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"西周金文字形“烈/刺”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"春秋金文字形“烈/刺”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“烈”字，上列下火\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“烈”字，形体一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“烈”字，形体二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“烈”字，形体三\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"楷书“烈”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0902/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n908:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000908\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 908, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"453760679fbb2b757d5352190b6be8b7839270297e565c2bbaa1b7b69eda57ef\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"f79011ee08f9a865345b44f877a8cdd94190f98b1cc6a2d37c5d5f55a3c7a72c\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_with_unidentified_printed_characters\"}, \"text\": \"熬炮爆煬爛尉燾炙灼\\n\\n[glyph:g001]²\\n《说文》或体\\n\\n[glyph:g002]¹—[glyph:g003]³—[glyph:g004]⁴—爛—烂\\n秦 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\\\___________爛—烂\\n楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《甲金篆》695页。2、3《说文》208页。4《隶辨》573页。\\n形声字。从火,闌或蘭声。本义为用火煮得熟透。《说文》:“爛,孰也。”“孰”即“熟”。《吕氏春秋·本味》:“故久而不弊,熟而不烂。”由用火(煮)引申为烧伤、烫伤;由熟透引申为熟得过度,引申为腐烂、溃烂。又引申为破碎、散乱、头绪混乱,为程度深或高,为明亮、光明,为鲜明有光彩。“烂”字早先字形不定,早期文字作从火、闌声的“爛”,小篆作从火、蘭声的“爛”,《说文》或体为从火、閒声的“[glyph:g001]”,这些字均笔画繁杂。现代汉字简化时,“蘭”据草书简化作“兰”;为便于书写,俗间为“爛”新创了一个从火、兰声的简化字“烂”,现代简化汉字时从之。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n尉\\nwèi 影组、物部;影组、未韵、於胃切。\\nyù 影组、物部;影组、物韵、纾物切。\\nyùn\\n[glyph:g005]¹—[glyph:g006]²—[glyph:g007]³—[glyph:g008]⁴—尉\\n秦 《说文》小篆 汉 汉 楷书\\n\\n1、3、4《甲金篆》695页。2《说文》208页。\\n会意字。从𡰥(夷),从又(右手),从火,表示用手持火熨烫织物使平展。本义为熨平。《说文》:“尉,从上案下也。从𡰥、又,持火以尉申缯也。”后“尉”多借用为官名,如“太尉”、“都尉”、“县尉”、“上尉”、“中尉”等,读作wèi;又借用为姓氏,读作yù。为区别词义,人们另造了一个从火、从尉、尉亦声的“熨”字来表示它的本义,读作yùn。早期文字左上为“[glyph:p001]”(“夷”的古字,义为平),左下为“火”,右为“寸”(从“又”附一画,与手有关);小篆结构略有变化,上为左“[glyph:p002]”、右“又”,下为“火”;后字形沿袭早期文字的结构,只是𡰥中的“二”与“火”合成“示”,写作“尉”。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n燾 jiāo 精组、宵部;精组、宵韵、即消切。\\n\\n[glyph:g009]¹—[glyph:g010]²—[glyph:g011]—[glyph:g012]\\n商 《说文》小篆 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《甲金篆》695页。2《说文》208页。\\n会意字。从火,从龜,表示用火烧灼龟壳。本义为灼龟而不显兆纹。《说文》:“燾,灼龟不兆也。……《春秋传》曰:‘龟燾不兆。’读若焦。”段玉裁注:“《左传·哀二年》:‘卜战,龟燾。’无‘不兆’二字。按:许所据盖有‘不兆’……焦者,火所伤也,龟焦曰燾。”甲骨文从“火”上蝗虫形,用为“秋”字。《合集》21715:“庚午卜,我贞:今熄(秋)我入商?”《合集》32968:“丁丑贞,今熄(秋)王其大史(使)?”一说,“火”上虫为“蜡”的象形本字,是天牛幼虫,也是庄稼害虫,故以火烧之护秋。在“秋”字中,“蜡”兼声符。“熄”即甲骨文的错讹变形。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n炙 jiù 见组、之部;见组、有韵、举有切。\\n\\n[glyph:g013]¹—[glyph:g014]²—[glyph:g015]³—炙\\n战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n\\n1、3《甲金篆》695页。2《说文》209页。\\n形声字。从火,久声。本义为烧灼。《说文》:“炙,灼也。”特指中医的一种治疗方法,即将艾绒所制的艾柱或艾条点燃后烧灼或熏烤人体穴位,以刺激皮肤或血脉,达到治疗的效果。《正字通·火部》:“炙,灼体疗病。”《庄子·盗跖》:“丘所谓无病而自灸也。”由艾柱、艾条引申指挂、支撑,又引申为堵塞。(郭小武 叶青)\\n\\n灼 zhuó 章组、药部;章组、药韵、之若切。\\n\\n[glyph:g016]¹—[glyph:g017]²—灼\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》209页。2《甲金篆》696页。\\n形声字。从火,勺声。本义为烧、灸。《说文》:“灼,炙也。”段玉裁改“炙”为“灸”,并注:“此与上‘灸’篆为转注。炙谓炮肉,灼谓凡物以火附箸之,如以楚焯(楚焯,灼龟用的荆木条)柱龟曰灼龟,其一耑(‘端’的古字)也。”《国语·鲁语下》:“如龟焉,灼其中,必文于外。”由烧引申为\\n\\n893\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0908/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0908/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0908/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"《说文》或体，从火从閒\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0908/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"秦代印化/篆体形式烂（从火从闌）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0908/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆，从火蘭声\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0908/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书烂\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0908/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"秦代文字尉\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0908/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆尉\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0908/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书尉（体一）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0908/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书尉（体二）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0908/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"p001\", \"description\": \"印刷体部件，𡰥字形，夷的古字\",