on, Oxford University Press 2014) is the current standard in Western sinological research.","title":"Old Chinese Pronunciation","url":"https://oc-tts.mgroth.se/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zi.tools","ref_id":"turn0search11","snippet":"StarLing database The Baxter-Sagart reconstruction of Old Chinese韻典網 ... 疒疢疓疔疕疖疗疘疙疚疜疝疞疠疡疣疤疥疦疧疨疩疪疫疬疭疮疯疰疱疲疳疴疵疶疷疸疹疺疻疼疽疾疿痀痁痂痃痄病痆症痈痉痊痋痌痍痎痏痐痑痒痓痔痕痖痗痘痙痚痛痜痝痞痟痠痡痢痣痤痥痦痧痨痪痫痬痭痮痯痰痱痲痳痴痵痶痷痸痹...","title":"痁: zi.tools","url":"https://zi.tools/zi/%E7%97%81"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"qiranjin.scholar.princeton.edu","ref_id":"turn0search14","snippet":"Shuowen jiezi ... Hanshu “Wuxing zhi:” 說曰: 痾, 病貌. ... 【C】Zhouli “Jiyi” 疾醫:春時有痟首疾.","title":"“The Root of the Classics”: Shuowen jiezi 說文解字and Confucian","url":"https://qiranjin.scholar.princeton.edu/sites/g/files/toruqf4316/files/documents/Qiran%20Jin_The%20Root%20of%20the%20Classics_Shuowen%20jiezi%20and%20Confucian%20Classical%20Studies%20in%20the%20Middle%20Eastern%20Han%20%2888%E2%80%93144%20CE%29.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.sinoss.net","ref_id":"turn0search15","snippet":"（2）87 乙：“治狗啮人创恿方：烦（燔）狼 ... 兩，另有一个常见异体“両”，《宋元以来俗字谱》云：“兩”，《白袍记》、《东牕记》、《目连记》、《金 ... ”与“両”相较，说明它们可能有渊源关系，后者很可能源 ... 病，《说文·疒部》：“从疒，丙声。”，是将“病”的构件“疒”省写为“广”的结果。","title":"Microsoft Word - 3866.doc","url":"https://www.sinoss.net/uploadfile/2010/1130/3866.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"api.zgcsxh.org.cn","ref_id":"turn0search16","snippet":"的是《说文》的“疾加也”，后来的一些词典多引此训将重病义作为首义即本义，也是暗 ... 说文》解字（词）说本义，说解却“从俗”，用当时通用义、引申 ... 病为主的疒部说解，用“病”34 条。 ... 为《辞源》误作重病义的","title":"中国辞书学报第三辑79 页—87 页（2021 年11 月出版）","url":"https://api.zgcsxh.org.cn/cishuxuehui/pdf/2022/03/23/724cc2f3-9d6c-4ee5-8fa5-06cf41c971dc.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search17","snippet":"Xu Shen sorted the Chinese lexicon into 540 sections, under section headers generally referred to as \"radicals\" in English: these may be entire characters or","title":"Shuowen Jiezi","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shuowen_Jiezi"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"upload.wikimedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search18","snippet":"病也, Sickness, n., 如 slight sickness, 微疾; Illness, n., 如 he has not yet been recovered from his illness, 其疾未愈; Indisposition, n., 如 to stay","title":"Chinese-English dictionary; comprising over 3,800 characters with translations, explanations, pronunciations","url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/Chinese-English_dictionary%3B_comprising_over_3%2C800_characters_with_translations%2C_explanations%2C_pronunciations_%28IA_chineseenglishdi00shanrich%29.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search19","snippet":"疾病（disease）是生物在一定原因的损害性作用下，因自稳调节紊乱而发生的异常生命活动过程，属于特定的異常病理情形，且會影響生物體部分或所有组织、器官、系统的功能、代谢和形态结构，致使其与内外环境间失衡而引起的各种症状、体征和行为异常。 ... 疾病通常被认为是与特定症狀及醫學徵象相关的「医疗状况」（medical condition）或「身體病況」，疾病可由病原体等外部（外在）因素引起，也可由","title":"疾病","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%96%BE%E7%97%85"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"oss.loveshangke.com","ref_id":"turn0search20","snippet":"5、内形外声 ... 病：《说文·疒部》：‚ ... 从疒， 丙声。","title":"古代汉语—文字\n主讲人：南风老师","url":"https://oss.loveshangke.com/r/jyfile/20230802/%E5%B9%BF%E4%B8%9C%E5%8F%A4%E4%BB%A3%E6%B1%89%E8%AF%AD%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E8%AF%BE_20230802145229.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search21","snippet":"Cn: 病字頭 bìngzìtóu ... 疒部，為漢字索引中的部首之一，康熙字典214個部首中的第一百〇四個（五劃的則為第十個）。 ... 从「爿」（「牀」象形初文和本字）从「人」，會人躺在牀上所以有疾病之意，是「疾」是會意初文。","title":"疒部","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%96%92%E9%83%A8"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search22","snippet":"Cn: 病字頭/病字头 bìngzìtóu ... Radical 104 or radical sickness (疒部) meaning \"sickness\" is one of the 23 Kangxi radical s (214 radicals in total) composed","title":"Radical 104","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radical_104"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search23","snippet":"“引起传染病的病原体”的含义最早记录在1728年， 远早于1892年德米特里·伊凡諾夫斯基发现病毒的时间。 ... The Onli