{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The review’s sound-role qualification needs one refinement: the book gives the alternative “从方声,” but the diagrams label a Warring States 病 form, Shuowen small seal, Qin, Han, and later clerical examples; the image captions do not identify which specimen supports the 方 analysis. I’ll cite the alternative as attributed and unresolved, without treating it as evidence that 方 is an established component."}}
